  "details": "Sometimes I like to do infinite/redirected walking, but currently the default turn speed on Vive controllers causes me to turn way too quickly, requiring me to turn in short fast bursts that do not look natural. If it was possible to do analog turning instead, based on how far from the middle of the trackpad one is pressing, this would allow for much better looking infinite/redirected walking using Vive controllers for input.",
